Package: rackatlas-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, systemd, coreutils, adduser
Maintainer: RackAtlas <noreply@localhost>
Description: RackAtlas monitoring agent
 Sends CPU, memory and disk usage and serious log entries to RackAtlas once
 a minute over HTTPS. Nothing connects into the server.
